<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA FIRST INV BANK HAS ZERO NET PROFIT IN '96.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA FIRST INV BANK HAS ZERO NET PROFIT IN '96.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's First Investment Bank</p>
<p>(FIB) posted a zero net profit for 1996 compared to 220 million</p>
<p>lev profit in 1995 under local accountancy standards, the</p>
<p>bank's annual report published in the State Gazette showed.</p>
<p>Last week the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) licensed the</p>
<p>European Bank for Reconstruction and Development to acquire up</p>
<p>to 20 percent in the FIB capital of five billion levs.</p>
<p>FIB annual results in million levs follow unless stated</p>
<p>otherwise:</p>
<p>						     1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total revenue			    86,606.743   4,846.628</p>
<p>Net income from financial</p>
<p>transactions				3,016.099     713.334</p>
<p>Extraordinary				 -25.394     -11.276</p>
<p>Business and administration costs     704.257     278.174</p>
<p>Taxes					     9.030	47.307</p>
<p>Profit						0.0     219.976</p>
<p>Provisions				  2,277.418     156.601</p>
<p>Shareholders equity		     2,271.373     800.000</p>
<p>Total assets			     25,192.347   5,721.524</p>
<p>Cash					  9,677.314     907.103</p>
<p>Treasury portfolio			  243.500   1,460.970</p>
<p>Interbank deposits extended	   7,884.345   2,108.711</p>
<p>Interbank deposits attracted	 14,632.695   2,854.915</p>
<p>Attracted deposits from		 5,746.363   1,529.185</p>
<p>non-financial clients</p>
<p>Lending to non-financial clients    5,380.597     821.063</p>
<p>Non-financial assets			726.157     355.182</p>
<p>Items not included in</p>
<p>the balance *			    67,459.111   6,654.187</p>
<p>* Under the Bulgarian accountancy standards items that are</p>
<p>not included in the balance include guarantees issued by the</p>
<p>bank and other commitments.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 911 88</p>
</text>
